Always read CURSOR.md at the start of every conversation in this project.
Never modify .env or expose API keys in any output.
Do not call api.airtable.com. Consultants, rates, logs, and opportunity status are in Supabase.
Always wrap log_agent_action() in try/except — it must never raise.
submission_deadline is a DATE — send YYYY-MM-DD, never a full timestamp.
A missing rate card leaves the budget incomplete. A missing availability value is Unknown, never free.
Never hardcode model strings — always use CLAUDE_MODEL and CLAUDE_MODEL_PROPOSAL from config.py.
When fixing bugs show exact lines to change, not the whole file unless asked.
The is_consultancy_contract gate in main.py must default to True when field is missing.
quick_relevance_check() must be permissive — the LLM consultancy gate does real quality filtering.
